### Register

POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "santiago123",
  "email": "santiago@gmail.com",
  "password": "Santiago123",
  "profile": {
    "firstName": "Santiago",
    "lastName": "Ramirez",
    "birthDate": "2005-06-15",
    "phone": "3704123456"
  }
}

### Login

POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "santiago123",
  "password": "Santiago123"
}


### GetEvents// a mirar respuesta/devuelve la password

GET  http://localhost:3000/api/events


### PostEvent
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
   
  "title": "Conferencia de Desarrollo Web 2026",
  "description": "Este es un evento de prueba con más de veinte caracteres para cumplir con la longitud mínima requerida.",
  "startDate": "2026-12-01T10:00:00.000Z",
  "endDate": "2026-12-01T18:00:00.000Z",
  "capacity": 100,
  "price": 25.50,
  "status": "scheduled",
  "location": {
    "venue": "Centro de Convenciones",
    "address": "Av. Siempre Viva 123",
    "city": "Springfield"
  }
}

